        <fig id="article-26083.image.f2" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease, Right Upper Lobe, Bulla, Lateral Chest Radiograph. Contributed by H Shulman, MD</p>
